<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Boston Beer cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Boston Beer cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist downgraded Boston Beer Co Inc to hold from buy, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- Boston Beer lost 5/8 to 9-1/4.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
